{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269nWy2jpaNg1793683286.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國中期選舉投票前夕，據報美軍以防禦性質為由，空襲伊朗一個島嶼。</p><p></p><p>伊朗國營傳媒報道，位於霍爾木茲海峽的格什姆島周二凌晨傳出爆炸聲。美聯社引述美方官員報道，伊朗利用防空導彈向美方開火，於是採取打擊行動。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.IRAN-1300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026F5x9VtOhUS1793683293.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>美國總統特朗普早前表示，不急於決定是否恢復打擊伊朗。霍士新聞認為，不代表美方對伊朗開始新一輪大規模攻擊。《華爾街日報》報道，美軍最近數周一直對伊朗進行有限度打擊，但刻意保持低調，未有公開宣布有關行動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:48.810446+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:39:04.475026+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:47.925812+00:00","content_hash":"d232d1dda737beabfaf60497fc1a42281a626d859dd186fdab0ac3afb8449774","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}